+### Inputs and Outputs
+**Inputs:**
+*   `points`: Array of shape $(N, D)$, where $N$ is the number of points and $D \ge 3$. The first three columns are coordinates $(x, y, z)$. Subsequent columns are features (e.g., color, intensity) [S3, S5, unofficial].
